# Must-read Overview
- Read `/docs/00-foundation/Project-Overview.md` before proposing changes.
- Reuse existing modules/services first; only create new when justified.

# Change discipline
- If new APIs/files are created, update:
  - `/docs/10-architecture/Modules.md`
  - `/docs/20-backend/openapi.json` (if HTTP)
  - `/docs/api/` (TypeDoc — ensure exports have TSDoc)
- Run `pnpm docs:all` in the same PR.
